{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google DeepMind近日正式公開WeatherNext 3氣象模型依託的SatWeave、PARDIG兩大基礎數據集，面向全球科研人員與開發者開放實時數據流及歷史歸檔資料，為天氣、水文、氣候研究及相關領域應用建模提供數據支撐。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586374.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.173287+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:55:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"9f3100dede0bfff2bb28aec3b433e15d3c2edbaf74637ad0653eae05db137be7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}